{"id": "section-body-29021", "title": "Alcohol Intoxication", "chapterId": "chapter-twenty-five", "tocLevel": 4, "tocPath": ["APPROACH TO PATIENTS WITH EMERGENCY CONDITIONS", "MENTAL HEALTH CONDITIONS", "Substance Related Disorder", "Alcohol Intoxication"], "blocks": [{"id": "body-29021", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading2", "text": "Alcohol Intoxication", "runs": [{"text": "Alcohol"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Intoxication"}], "level": 2, "list": {"level": 1, "numberingId": "154"}}, {"id": "body-29022", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "Management of alcohol intoxication see mental health conditions on chapter 23.", "runs": [{"text": "Management"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "of"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "alcohol"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "intoxication"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "see"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "mental"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "health"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "conditions"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "on"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "chapter"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "23."}]}, {"id": "body-29024", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading2", "text": "Bites and Stings", "runs": [{"text": "Bites"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Stings"}], "level": 2, "list": {"level": 1, "numberingId": "154"}}, {"id": "body-29025", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "Most serious sting-related reactions are caused by insects of the order Hymenoptera, particularly: Bees, Wasps and Ants. Other arthropods/venomous creatures that may also cause bites or stings include: Spiders, Scorpions, Centipedes, Millipedes.", "runs": [{"text": "Most"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "serious"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "sting-related"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "reactions"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "are"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "caused"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "by"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "insects"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "of"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "order"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Hymenoptera,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "particularly: Bees,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Wasps"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Ants. Other"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "arthropods/venomous"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "creatures"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "that"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "may"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "also"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "cause"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "bites"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "or"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "stings"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "include:"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Spiders,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Scorpions,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Centipedes,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Millipedes."}]}, {"id": "body-29027", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "Clinical Presentation", "runs": [{"text": "Clinical"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Presentation"}], "level": 4}, {"id": "body-29028", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "Localized pain at the bite/sting site, Swelling, Redness, Itching. Severe reactions may include: Generalized urticaria, Angioedema, Wheezing, Difficulty breathing, Hypotension, Anaphylaxis.", "runs": [{"text": "Localized"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "pain"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "at"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "bite/sting"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "site,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Swelling,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Redness,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Itching."}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Severe"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "reactions"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "may"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "include:"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Generalized"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "urticaria, Angioedema, Wheezing, Difficulty breathing, Hypotension, Anaphylaxis."}]}, {"id": "body-29031", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "Non-Pharmacological Management", "runs": [{"text": "Non-Pharmacological"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Management"}], "level": 4}, {"id": "body-29032", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Clean the affected area with soap and water to remove contaminants", "runs": [{"text": "Clean"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "affected"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "area"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "with"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "soap"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "water"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "to remove contaminants"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "110"}}, {"id": "body-29033", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "If a stinger is present (e.g., bee sting), remove it gently by scraping with a fingernail, card, or gauze", "runs": [{"text": "If a stinger is present (e.g., bee sting), remove it gently"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "by"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "scraping with a fingernail,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "card,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "or"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "gauze"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "110"}}, {"id": "body-29034", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Avoid using tweezers because they may squeeze additional venom into the wound", "runs": [{"text": "Avoid using tweezers because they may squeeze additional venom into the wound"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "110"}}, {"id": "body-29036", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Apply a cold compress/cold pack wrapped in cloth to reduce pain and swelling", "runs": [{"text": "Apply a cold compress/cold pack wrapped in cloth to reduce pain and swelling"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "110"}}, {"id": "body-29037", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Avoid scratching to prevent skin breakdown and secondary infection", "runs": [{"text": "Avoid"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "scratching"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "to"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "prevent"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "skin"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "breakdown"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and secondary infection"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "110"}}, {"id": "body-29040", "ty